# Git authorship

Mandatory. Every commit in this repository must be **David Ramirez** only.

## Identity

- Name: `David Ramirez`
- Email: `rxgdavid@gmail.com`

Set `user.name` and `user.email` to those values before committing. Pass the same identity as `GIT_AUTHOR_*` and `GIT_COMMITTER_*` if the environment defaults to something else.

## Never

- Author or committer `Cursor`, `Cursor Agent`, or `cursoragent@cursor.com`
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor co-author trailer
- A Cursor author with the user as co-author (or the reverse)

If a hook or wrapper injects a Cursor trailer, strip it before the commit is created (or amend immediately so HEAD has no Cursor attribution).
